# The wine given to the Portuguese taxi driver (BUGS.md B45): his drinking
# animation holds the bottle, so the offered one must not be drawn as well.
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --headless --scene 2fportdi --take 86 --fix all --ms 6000 --input tools/play/taxi-wine.input
#
# Without the fix (or with -drinker_takes_bottle) the check fails, as the
# original draws both.
300 move 320 240
1000 offer 0 446 200
3600 drawn 86 0
4500 drawn 86 0
5500 expect 2abarbei
